.TH TTTT 6.SH NAMEtttt \- tic-tac-toe on a four-by-four board.SH SYNOPSIS\fBtttt\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONTic-Tac-Toc-Toe, by Eric Lechner: noughts and crosses against thecomputer on a board of four by four, so three in a row is not enough.Name a square by its column letter and row digit,\fBb1\fR;\fR\fBq\fRquits.  It draws with VT100 sequences.